  "description": "Sung Ha-Gyeom is a rich, spoiled omega who aimlessly cruises through life, leaving chaos in his wake with his carefree behavior. But when a scandal complicates everything, his father forces him to live in the countryside with Doh Do-Hoon, a humble, beta gardener who owes him a favor. At first, Ha-Gyeom is bored out of his mind, but then he catches a glimpse of Do-Hoon's naked, muscular body, and the boredom vanishes. Will Ha-Gyeom's wily charms win Do-Hoon over, or will Do-Hoon's rose garden heal the unruly Hagyeom?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
